# What the image builds never need, and some they must never contain.
# Without this file the build context was several GB (dependencies, build
# output, virtual environments), and a local build copied apps/api-gateway's
# .env (secrets) and data/ (stored customer files) into the gateway image.

.git
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.egg-info
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Secrets and per-machine settings; the examples are kept.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.production.example

# Stored files and local state.
**/data
backups
tmp
output
.rush-global
coverage
